WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:08.150
The grimoire is a book of magic;
whoever holds it controls the world.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:12.820
They're confident that the key to
knowing the grimoire's whereabouts

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.110
lies in the Tachibana family.

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:18.120
This is a ring of the Sacred Lux.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.580
It's sure to keep you safe.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.290
The Sacred Lux...

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:26.630
If you want to go to school
that badly, I don't mind.

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:30.300
However... I'll be going, too.
Starting tomorrow.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.420
<i>What</i>?

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:06.980
"B-Boying of Vainglory and Impulse"

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.440
You transferred in from England?
How great is that?

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:19.660
So you must be good at English.
Can you teach me?

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.530
Aren't returnee students the coolest?

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:22.660
Not especially.

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:28.660
Whoa! He sure is popular!

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:31.380
I never thought he'd go through with it!

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.090
Ritsuka!

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.590
Huh? You know her?

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:38.590
Who <i>is</i> she?

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:40.970
Hey, Ritsuka! Who's that?

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:44.260
Ooh! And this ring! Looks pricey!

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:46.100
Did <i>he</i> give it to you?

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.100
Are you dating?

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.770
--No way! You go, girl!
--You've got it all wrong! He's my <i>brother</i>!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:51.480
He is? Really?

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:57.740
The Byzantine Empire
asked Pope Urban II for help

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:04.160
in recapturing the Holy Land,
then occupied by the Seljuk dynasty.

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:10.120
It's sure to keep you safe.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.250
They're devils.

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.250
Now, this proclamation--

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:26.430
M-Mr. Nanashiro! We're in the middle of class!

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:27.600
Mr. Nanashiro!

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:36.110
C'mere a sec.

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.980
Huh? What--

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.820
What <i>is</i> all this?

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:44.700
--Hey, let me go! Hey!

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.990
--Stop that! Let her go!
--Hey, let me go! Hey!

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:49.790
Ritsuka!

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:57.000
Shaddup.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.010
Let me go!

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:03.130
Hey--

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:04.220
Wait!

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.180
Oh, geez.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:14.850
Now, this proclamation would spark the Crusades,

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:17.400
a holy war that would involve
everyone in the Catholic world

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.820
--over the next two centuries.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:19.860
--Ritsuka!
--over the next two centuries.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:23.990
Lindo...

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:36.960
Here comes the exorcist who thinks
he's a knight in shining armor.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.460
Meddlesome insects must be removed.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:41.170
Oops!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.170
My hand slipped.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:47.260
A new source of intel has joined us from abroad.

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:49.850
We ought to use it, no?

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:56.020
He has the backing of the Exorcist Society.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:59.770
Soon it will be too much
for them to keep an eye on us.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:05.450
Huh. Then I guess you can keep
playing human with that girl.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:08.620
I'm taking more surefire measures, that's all.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.370
I suppose you must.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:16.040
After all, failure's not an option
for the heir to the Arlond family.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.170
Mage?

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:39.400
Why all the trembling?

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:44.990
Afraid of heights?
I guess humans <i>would</i> die if they fell.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:51.950
What are you so scared for?

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:55.000
This kinda thing would never kill a devil!

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.170
A devil?

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:02.920
Yeah,

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:04.380
that's right.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:13.220
They're... they're real...

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:17.850
Now, if you don't want your soul devoured,

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:21.690
tell me where the forbidden grimoire is.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:25.650
I-I don't know.

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:32.780
Pretty gutsy. I'll show you
what happens when you defy a devil!

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:34.580
No!

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:55.770
That damn exorcist--thinks he's sooo clever.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:00.900
Be mine.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:02.150
Huh?

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:06.530
Then you'll gladly tell me
where the grimoire is, right?

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:11.700
I told you, I don't know!
And what do you mean, "be mine"?

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:16.370
You know: fall in love with me!

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:21.000
There's not a soul who doesn't fall for me
hard once they see what I can do.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:28.880
Wh-What?!

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:33.300
Come on, already.
I'll show you something terrific.

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:43.440
♪ I shoot for number one with my mind--
if you diss me, you die ♪

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:44.650
♪ That's loner style ♪

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:48.150
♪ Gonna bust through the faith of the punk
lookin' for the one and only ♪

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:51.740
♪ Vanquish: gonna be a self-made man--
that's the plan ♪

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:55.320
♪ Vanquish: hey, yo, bring it on! ♪

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:58.910
♪ Vanquish: I'm a man's man,
and everybody's enthralled ♪

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:02.420
♪ I'll give you VIP dreams ♪

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:05.960
♪ Vanquish: Sear this off-the-charts
power into your eyeballs ♪

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:09.510
♪ Vanquish: say "Mage is the great!" ♪

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:13.090
♪ Vanquish: I'll get the grimoire <i>and</i> the girl ♪

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:16.640
♪ Now be mine, already! ♪

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:20.180
♪ Tell a lie: for a devil, it's a piece of cake ♪

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:23.520
♪ Or a frontal attack, yeah, it's okay ♪

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:27.310
♪ Blow off those creeps, Rem, Urie, and Shiki ♪

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:32.240
♪ I'm gonna snatch you away ♪

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:39.540
♪ A piercing desire that goes on forever ♪

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:46.330
♪ I'll break all their stupid rules (break 'em) ♪

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:53.970
♪ Wanna chase the now that never ends ♪

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.630
♪ Fists up! Aim for the summit! ♪

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.510
♪ Bring it on--I'm ready to rumble! ♪

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:03.390
♪ No one can snuff out the impulse
that burns all through me! ♪

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:24.330
Ugh, nasty! Human food always tastes like crap.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.210
Sure could go for a tasty soul...

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.750
You're not eating?

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:38.180
As if I could just blithely
dig right in at a time like this.

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:40.390
You're a stubborn one.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:43.850
No wonder Rem can't handle you.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:47.730
I never did like him.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:51.070
Always looking down on you
with that cool expression.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:56.820
Rem's... not like that.

00:09:56.820 --> 00:10:00.240
Ha. He's got you right where he wants you.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:06.120
You got took. You know that devils lie, right?

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.500
But... he couldn't have...

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:12.250
Me, I don't go in for
that kind of roundabout trickery.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:16.630
My power's what got me where I am today.

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:19.590
Well? You're smitten, right?

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:23.060
Everyone who falls for my
dynamic power and manliness

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:26.270
winds up wanting to be my underling.

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:31.110
Go on--call me "boss".

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:33.690
I won't tag along after anyone
who abducts me against my will

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:36.320
without even listening to what I have to say!

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:37.400
Whaaat?

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:42.280
Now listen: I've never gone
this far with anyone before, and--

00:10:57.380 --> 00:11:02.140
It's you... that amazing smell.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:07.140
Let me go!

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:08.100
Where are you going?

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:09.140
The bathroom!

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:12.440
Why's she so mad?

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:21.360
I've got to get out of here.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:43.010
If I can just get to the police
and call my brother...

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:04.410
What are you running from?

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:06.370
I, uh...

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:12.370
Eh?

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:21.300
I was just in the middle of dinner.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:24.550
You don't look that tasty, but I can deal.

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:41.990
Now look: she got away again.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:45.860
And your lousy souls won't make up for it.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.550
Tastier than duck legs.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:10.140
Help me... somebody!

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:12.350
No!

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.640
Calm down. It's me.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.900
Rem?

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:24.900
Ritsuka.

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.570
I've come for you.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:40.210
Once this reaches the airfield,
my private plane will take you home.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.000
It'll be okay.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.010
How did you know where I was?

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.880
Your brother will be worried, too.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:49.050
You ought to get in touch with him right away.

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.930
Um, I...

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:53.520
Thank goodness you're all right, anyway.

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:57.310
What is it?

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:02.650
Thank goodness I'm all right...

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:06.110
...because I'm your key to the grimoire?

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:17.410
I trusted you.
You were so kind to me. And yet...

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:23.800
You're... a devil, aren't you.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:36.770
I live to fulfill the purpose I have been given.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:41.230
I require absolute power and an obedient pawn.

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:47.280
You are merely one of those.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:52.740
Stay back!

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:07.050
Rem. What brings <i>you</i> here?

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:11.090
You seem to not know your own place, Mage.

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:16.970
That's <i>my</i> pawn. I will not allow it
to belong to the likes of you.

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:23.980
Everything I'd so carefully
put together is ruined because of you.

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:27.570
I ought to deal with you right here and now.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:33.370
This one belongs to <i>me</i>.
Go play your little games by yourself!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.120
Rem!

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:52.380
You <i>will</i> be mine... that's for certain!

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:03.480
What happened to all the screaming?

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:09.530
What a pain.

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:23.210
Well? Isn't this the kind of thing
you humans think is pretty?

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.420
Sheesh.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:30.090
So Rem's a devil. Is it really
worth getting so depressed about?

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:35.390
No... that's not it.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:39.260
You--

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:53.490
So sweet...

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:11.090
Wh-What? What <i>are</i> you? How--I--

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:13.630
Ritsuka!

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:28.270
Sorry.

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:32.690
Dammit. Moving on.

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:44.450
Prostrate thyself before me,
o ye who lurk in darkness.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.330
Though thou wouldst
veil thyself in the shadows...

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.420
...be thou driven out by my hand!

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:55.220
Lindo? But how--

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:59.010
Foul devil! Do not lay one
corrupted finger on Ritsuka!

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.900
What have you done?!

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:13.320
Ha! You incompetent exorcist--
all you can do is wait in ambush?

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:16.860
You're too late! She's already mine!

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:20.320
I am <i>not</i>! Now let me go already!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:23.870
I'll kill you.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.660
I won't allow anyone--not anyone--

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.250
to besmirch Ritsuka!

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.000
Lindo?

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.760
Those eyes...

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:42.300
I get it now. And I don't like it one bit!

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:43.720
Silence!

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:47.770
Lindo!

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:52.020
--What's wrong?
--O ye who lurk in darkness,
obey my voice and pledge

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.110
--that thou wouldst utter before
it only the truth in all things.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:55.780
--Say what you like. It doesn't matter.
--that thou wouldst utter before
it only the truth in all things.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:58.650
I'll use my power to <i>make</i> you surrender!

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:00.160
Pledge to me!

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:17.340
I don't care who you are--
I'll crush anyone who gets in my way

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:19.840
with my own two hands.

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:22.680
This next one will end it!

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:27.470
I'll kill you... unforgiveable... kill you...

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:29.270
Lindo...

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:34.730
Protect... Ritsuka...
even if it costs me my life...

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:37.480
Stop...

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:39.070
Die!

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:40.360
Perish!

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:41.610
Stop!

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.490
Ritsuka!

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:52.170
Ritsuka!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:55.250
You...

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:57.710
Big brother... thank goodness...

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:02.470
This party sure got old fast.

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:07.600
Later, Ritsuka!

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:11.520
Next time for sure,
I'll have you saying you're mine!

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.610
Ritsuka, are you all right?

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:19.990
I'm fine. It was nothing.

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:25.450
Lindo?

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:31.460
Forgive me. I was with you, and yet...

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:33.870
No, it's okay.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:38.210
Thanks for saving me, big brother.

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:51.520
Hmph. All these jokers getting in my way.

00:20:57.480 --> 00:21:00.320
Her scent--it's soaked right in.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.040
It was so sweet...

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:18.380
Whoa! Geez, Shiki!
Don't go startling me like that!

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:24.220
Your face is all red. Gross, Mage.

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:27.340
I-It is not, either! I'm gonna murder you!

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:33.730
How I wish you would...
but I'll have to pass for now.

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:37.600
I have something waiting for me
that'll <i>really</i> make me shiver.

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:48.370
Hurry into my hand--

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:51.410
I'll lock you away for a lifetime.

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:59.670
<i>It's a secret you can't tell anyone</i>

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:10.260
<i>Wonth gir sliv edhti wecnad</i>

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.720
<i>Wonth gir</i>

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:17.350
<i>Cracking a smile only at the witching hour</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:20.270
<i>Spreading rumors sotto voce</i>

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:22.820
<i>You knocked on the door</i>

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:26.360
<i>Without looking behind you</i>

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:30.030
<i>With all these mysteries, impossible to solve</i>

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>You stopped cold, weak in the knees</i>

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:35.500
<i>It hacks everything</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:37.750
<i>The curse of love</i>

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.000
<i>The curse--and you</i>

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:44.420
<i>If you're confused about the touch on your skin</i>

00:22:44.420 --> 00:22:48.050
<i>We just can't be transparent</i>

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:51.800
<i>Soon (soon)</i>

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:54.510
<i>Won't you take this hand?</i>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:02.310
<i>Mademoiselle, mademoiselle:
I'll make you happy</i>

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:06.110
<i>This night will never come again</i>

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:08.990
<i>So let us swear to one another</i>

00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:16.290
<i>The black clown singing of love
at the tip of the moon</i>

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:18.120
<i>Obscuring the sky</i>

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:23.040
<i>Casting a spell with a bewitching fever</i>

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:30.300
Yes, that's the face--how it makes me shiver!

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:31.890
We'll be together forever.

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:35.400
Otherwise... I'll kill you.

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:41.020
"Farandole of Reminiscence and Labyrinths"

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:40.810
Act 6: Farandole of Reminiscence and Labyrinths.
